cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  The manuscript associated with this results package is currently submitted
  to Data & Knowledge Engineering and has not yet been accepted or assigned a
  DOI. Until publication, please cite this dataset directly (see below) or
  contact the corresponding author for guidance. Update the
  "preferred-citation" block with the DOI/volume/issue once the paper is
  published.
type: dataset
title: "NoiseProj-CF: Public Results and Evidence Data"
abstract: >-
  Generated result tables (CSV) supporting the manuscript "NoiseProj-CF:
  Noise-Adjusted Low-Rank Indexing for Compact and Corruption-Robust Dense
  Retrieval". Covers six BEIR datasets and three frozen sentence-embedding
  encoders under a qrel-free, document-calibrated, noise-adjusted low-rank
  projection (frozen protocol 4.0.2-final), including main effectiveness,
  secondary metrics, dimension efficiency, unseen/observed corruption
  generalization, cross-corpus transfer, vector-index system trade-offs, and
  bootstrap statistical inference.
